            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Sealer Assist is on a Permanent Hiatus I would love to come back, but there was just not enough interest.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE DEMO IS NOW AVAILABLE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sealer Assist is a Turn based RPG Deck-building game with a lot of different builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of a Sealer is an earned weapon set that not everyone can use, take out on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >journey of one of said Sealers, beginning first in the Moon Elf Village. Set thousands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of years after &quot;&quot;Something&quot;&quot; happens on earth causing an apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY RELEASE GAME FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 150 Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interesting enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill &amp; Turn based Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Developed by a Community of Dedicated fans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enriched Story</p></li></ul>",
